# A seventeenth Russian story: the exam
subtitle: "Tom sits the Russian ТРКИ-1 exam and writes to Ольга that evening: read his letter in Russian, and hear him read it."
tags: ["russian","russian reading","russian story","trki exam","russian letter"]
teaches: ["reading/reading-letters","reading/reading-stories"]
thumb: "band \"A seventeenth Russian story: the exam\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Translating for my parents in Russian: she asks whether…","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/171-russian-translating.cast"}

